[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS017
TITLE: On link down, send nothing and continue the last maneuver
STATEMENT: >>>
When the link reports down, further requests, readbacks, repeats, and emergency declarations shall not be sent. A taxi already accepted shall continue on later time steps. A clearance delivered while the link is down shall not be accepted. Acceptance is a down event during taxi after which the phrase log does not grow, an emergency call adds no phrase, and the aircraft is still taxiing farther along the path.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The last accepted clearance remains the only maneuver.
<<<
DAL: E
